        "M050-SRC-PA-001::ATOM-PA-DIRECT-0284"
      ],
      "canonical_claim": "`Away.Crossing` is both a semantic unit and the parent of Crossing's internal ontology. Crossing is uniquely forked among Registers into canonical Mouse, Rabbit, and Squirrel branches because each Core Species has materially different planning, affordance, movement, safety, and failure grammar; these are branches of one Register, not generic species tags or modifiers to one universal procedure.",
