      "primary_msid": "Away.Crossing",
      "rationale": "The sources agree on a one-plan, continuous-run contour and reject turn-based or tactical structures. Immediate execution decisions are compatible with the prohibition on reopening strategic planning, and severe consequences may transition to MEET without changing Crossing's own grammar.",
      "related_local_ids": [],
