        "M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0009-B00274-1",
        "M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0009-B00275-1"
      ],
      "canonical_claim": "Crossing's consequence ladder includes cargo loss, persistent Shaken or Fear Memory, Tharn, and rare death. Cargo loss abandons, scatters, or crushes a carried object, food bundle, or Supply. Fear is a named Condition that can affect later volunteering, Crossing posture, or MEET options. Tharn interrupts the sequence and makes rescue or abandonment the immediate question. Death is rare, explicit, and visible, and visible catastrophe remains visible during Crossing.",
      "human_question": null,
      "members": [
