        "M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0010-B00295-2",
        "M050-SRC-AWAY-001::AWAY-C0025-B00760-2"
      ],
      "canonical_claim": "The fixed 70/20/10 return-Crossing roll is retired and replaced by burden-based return logic. Every returning party reaches the far-side Staging Post, where Return Burden is evaluated from time of day, traffic, route familiarity, load, injury, fear, party cohesion, and weather. Low burden receives a cinematic or abbreviated sequence, moderate burden a compressed Crossing with fewer windows and one decisive intervention, and high burden a full manual Crossing; each presentation must keep the accumulated cost and final passage legible.",
