      ],
      "canonical_claim": "Crow is an exception to the ground-party Crossing grammar: it auto-crosses in parallel under a distinct hidden avian adjudication affected by River Spume and roadway turbulence. Its result is independent of the ground party and is limited to Clean Flight, Buffeted, Cargo Drop of one eligible ordinary item but never an Artifact, or Injury. Crow may provide the ground party a deliberately modest aerial-information or success benefit. Most other land-bound Guests follow the Core Species grammar.",
